  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Desarrollo Sistema Capacitacin y Empleo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training and Employment System Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To encourage a more efficient functioning of the labor market through improved worker competitiveness, labor and sound labor market policies. Specifically, it will: (i) develop a model to improve the labor market performance and insertion of un and underemployed youth and disadvantaged workers; (ii) develop an in-firm training model; and (iii) strengthen the capacity of the Ministry to modernize labor market training and employment programs and advance policy making.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
